<title>MEXICO: Bimbo 1997 Q1 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Bimbo 1997 Q1 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  144.97 million	     118.39 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 4.083 bln		3.706 bln</p>
<p>     Oper Income	386.85 million	     232.27 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   69.03 million	gain  112.10 million</p>
<p>	 NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	 Full company name is Grupo Industrial Bimbo SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
